## Cohesion Audit: `src/blog/people/drafts/Nara-Smith.md`

### Central Thesis
Nara Smith is a self-preservation Type 8 whose defining refusal is not aggression but being placed inside a frame she did not author — which is why the timing of her disclosures and her rejection of the tradwife label are the same move.

